                                                "sense_id": "3bb7cdbc-713d-337c-a914-cbf8dd0ce704",
                                                "text": "Great God of VVaters [i.e., Neptune], vvhoſe extended Svvay / Is next to his, vvhom Heav'n and Earth obey: / Let not the Suit of Venus thee diſpleaſe, / Pity the Floaters on th' Ionian Seas."
